WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.750
Here's Director's Lookbook in under a minute.

00:02.800 --> 00:04.910
Step one: pick what you're making.

00:04.960 --> 00:07.630
Photo, video, website or game.

00:07.680 --> 00:10.270
Step two: start with a feeling.

00:10.320 --> 00:12.030
Rainy cafe at night.

00:12.080 --> 00:13.070
Get the look.

00:13.120 --> 00:14.990
Step three: your look.

00:15.040 --> 00:20.110
A camera, a light, a film stock and a palette, each with the name directors use.

00:20.160 --> 00:21.550
Not sure about one card?

00:21.600 --> 00:22.430
Tap New.

00:22.480 --> 00:23.790
Liked the last one better?

00:23.840 --> 00:24.750
Tap back.

00:24.800 --> 00:28.030
Copy the prompt, and paste it into your image or video tool.

00:28.080 --> 00:29.790
Or start from a ready look.

00:29.840 --> 00:32.750
Or build it yourself, one step at a time.

00:32.800 --> 00:34.990
Each step opens a sheet with pictures.

00:35.040 --> 00:37.950
Tap the one you like, then add and next.

00:38.000 --> 00:39.550
Or scroll the library.

00:39.600 --> 00:41.470
Every card shows an example.

00:41.520 --> 00:42.910
Director's Lookbook.

00:42.960 --> 00:44.030
Say the feeling.

00:44.080 --> 00:45.590
Get the look.
